{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "Need for relaxation", "depth": 1, "parent_id": null, "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.6894261141031155, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, just a bit of quiet time lately is nice, I guess. Like, I was stressing about work and... you know, I just enjoy the calm.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 128}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Yeah, sometimes I just need to zone out with a good book or listen to music.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 76}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, just a bit of quiet time lately is nice, I guess.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 55}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261007T124751Z", "last_updated_at": "20261007T125123Z", "first_seen_session": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": true}
{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "Need to process work-related stress", "depth": 2, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, just a bit of quiet time lately is nice, I guess. Like, I was stressing about work and... you know, I just enjoy the calm.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 128}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's more about missing my alone time, I guess. Not really work stuff. Just being with the kids all day gets tiring.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 116}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Last week was tough with work", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 111}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Last week was tough with work, but I did find myself looking forward to the kids' naps more than usual.", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 185}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "work has been really stressful", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 36}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "work has been really stressful.", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 37}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "those quiet moments are the only break I get.", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "I don't want to feel guilty about it.", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 56}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I shouldn’t be looking forward to the kids sleeping, right? It’s weird.", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 123}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "Sometimes I just need to remind myself that it’s okay to take those breaks.", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 141}, {"session_id": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I'm trying to stay on top of things, but some days, I just enjoy the quiet when the kids are napping.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 101}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261007T124751Z", "last_updated_at": "20261007T125759Z", "first_seen_session": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000181-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
